Química verde no Brasil: 2010–2030 — MCT/CGEE (@ic-green-brazil: 0, is #reference, #part-of @ic-sources) { r_6C2MG2T0DTT5FDCA24NFY2FTW5
Ministério da Ciência e Tecnologia and Centro de Gestão e Estudos Estratégicos. Química verde no Brasil: 2010–2030, revised and updated edition, Brasília, 2010. ISBN 9788560755318. [Institutional record and full text](https://livroaberto.ibict.br/handle/123456789/661) · [Government-hosted edition](https://repositorio.mcti.gov.br/bitstream/mctic/5184/1/2010_quimica_verde_no_brasil_2010-2030.pdf).

Read the whole introduction and complete relevant biochemical/thermochemical biorefinery, alcohol, oil, sugar, carbon-dioxide, plant-product and bioproduct chapters. The sustained renewable-chemical study uses the whole book and later full primary evidence, testing its assumptions against actual process boundaries. This is a dated technological/strategic study; its scenarios are not observations of what subsequently happened.

The institutional identity, 2010 edition, contents and reuse notice were checked on 29 October 2026. The revised book states 438 pages while an institutional catalogue describes 433; identify the actual edition used. Its notice allows attributed reproduction/storage/transmission of text, with rights reserved otherwise; do not replace this with an invented CC licence or assume every component has identical terms. No copy is bundled.

